The world is wider than most will ever truly appreciate. Wider than many will even know.
Full of life, spirit monsters moving through the land, bonding with our hearts, growing in the trees.
And the Divine Forest, the heart of that life, keeps it flowing throughout the world with the blessing of the gods enshrined there.
